# TcpSession behavior examples.

EXAMPLE context manager sets ContextVar
  GIVEN host = "127.0.0.1", port = 9600
  WHEN enter session
  THEN get_active_session() is session

EXAMPLE exit resets ContextVar
  GIVEN active session
  WHEN exit session
  THEN get_active_session() is None

EXAMPLE call succeeds on first attempt
  GIVEN connected session
  WHEN call(payload)
  THEN returns response bytes

EXAMPLE reconnect once on connection drop
  GIVEN connected session, reader fails with ConnectionResetError
  WHEN call(payload)
  THEN reconnects, retries, returns response

EXAMPLE double failure raises
  GIVEN connected session, both attempts fail
  WHEN call(payload)
  THEN raises ConnectionError

EXAMPLE nested sessions restore outer
  GIVEN outer session active
  WHEN enter inner session, exit inner
  THEN get_active_session() is outer
